{"lines": ["Two hundred thousand antelope dropped dead in three weeks. And scientists were right there, watching.", "Kazakhstan, 2015. Saiga, antelope with huge drooping noses, gathered on the steppe to give birth.", "Then the mothers stopped grazing, stood still, and collapsed. Every sick one died.", "Their calves kept trying to feed. Hours later, they died too.", "But that's not the strange part. Herds hundreds of kilometres apart died the same week.", "It wasn't spreading. One vet said it was like a switch turned on in each animal.", "Then labs found the killer. A germ that lives, harmless, in every saiga's nose.", "Case closed? Not even close. Why turn deadly in every herd at once?", "One study blamed hot, humid weather. Another found no weather link.", "So what flipped the switch? Weather, or a second killer nobody's found? Tell me below."], "words": [["Two", 0.0, 0.187], ["hundred", 0.187, 0.622], ["thousand", 0.622, 1.12], ["antelope", 1.12, 1.7], ["dropped", 1.7, 2.06], ["dead", 2.06, 2.52], ["in", 2.52, 2.76], ["three", 2.76, 3.0], ["weeks.", 3.0, 3.36], ["And", 3.86, 3.96], ["scientists", 3.96, 4.48], ["were", 4.48, 4.84], ["right", 4.84, 5.08], ["there,", 5.08, 5.38], ["watching.", 5.38, 5.72], ["Kazakhstan,", 6.574, 6.78], ["2015.", 6.78, 8.5], ["Saiga,", 9.3, 9.66], ["antelope", 9.66, 10.52], ["with", 10.52, 10.8], ["huge", 10.8, 11.0], ["drooping", 11.0, 11.62], ["noses,", 11.62, 12.0], ["gathered", 12.0, 12.48], ["on", 12.48, 12.94], ["the", 12.94, 13.06], ["steppe", 13.06, 13.3], ["to", 13.3, 13.54], ["give", 13.54, 13.7], ["birth.", 13.7, 14.04], ["Then", 14.677, 14.78], ["the", 14.78, 14.88], ["mothers", 14.88, 15.08], ["stopped", 15.08, 15.4], ["grazing,", 15.4, 15.8], ["stood", 15.9, 16.48], ["still,", 16.48, 16.94], ["and", 16.94, 17.12], ["collapsed.", 17.12, 17.38], ["Every", 18.16, 18.3], ["sick", 18.3, 18.6], ["one", 18.6, 18.84], ["died.", 18.84, 19.14], ["Their", 19.856, 19.96], ["calves", 19.96, 20.24], ["kept", 20.24, 20.56], ["trying", 